  "bodyHash": "9ce2e3523b807187",
  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組為 Macaw 的橋樑/柵欄/屋頂/家具/階梯/道路/活板門/門/窗戶，以及 TerraformersMC 開發的模組提供多相容性支援。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>無論是 Traverse、Cinderscapes 還是 Terrestria。</p>\n<p>此模組會自動使用其他模組的材料來新增橋樑、屋頂或柵欄。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組為 Macaw 系列模組的非官方擴充套件。若遇到當機或錯誤問題，請至該<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題頁面</a>回報。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模組支援：&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Traverse</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1109/231/2025-02-25_19.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Cinderscapes</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1109/233/2025-02-25_21.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Terrestria</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1109/232/2025-02-25_21.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>必要依賴：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用依賴：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw 的模組</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Traverse（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>）</p>\n<p>Cinderscapes（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>）</p>\n<p>Terrestria（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrestria-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrestria\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>）</p>",
